          "holding": "The Third Circuit reversed summary judgment for the caseworker, holding that a caseworker who lacked objectively reasonable grounds to believe a child had been abused or was in imminent danger violated the family's Fourteenth Amendment liberty interest by forcing the father to leave the home under threat of removal.",
